Or is our Universe just one member of a cosmic family of Universes,

698
00:37:51,310 --> 00:37:56,240
分布在陌生的版图上？
spread across a strange and uncharted landscape?

699
00:37:56,350 --> 00:37:58,010
就在几年前
Just a few years ago,

700
00:37:58,120 --> 00:38:02,380
就算问这种问题，都是难以置信的
even asking these questions was unthinkable.

701
00:38:02,490 --> 00:38:07,080
但我们离答案很近了
Now we're close to finding the answer.

702
00:38:07,190 --> 00:38:10,750
Sasha确信
Sasha Kashlinsky is convinced

703
00:38:10,860 --> 00:38:15,290
那些在我们宇宙边缘的神秘力量
that some mysterious attractor at the edge of our Universe

704
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:17,420
正牵引着我们的星系
is pulling on galaxies,

705
00:38:17,540 --> 00:38:22,100
把它们拉向被称为暗流的地方
forcing them to move with what he calls "dark flow."

706
00:38:22,210 --> 00:38:24,430
他的工作还很有争论性
His work is still controversial,

707
00:38:24,540 --> 00:38:27,800
为了取信怀疑论者，他需要更多的证据
and to convince the skeptics,he needs more data.

708
00:38:27,910 --> 00:38:30,370
我们希望，在几年内
We hope,in a few years,

709
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:36,310
能把2.000个星系簇记录进来
to have a catalog of up to 2,000 galaxy clusters in total.

710
00:38:36,420 --> 00:38:40,010
在新的数据里面，我们希望能够
And with the new data,we hope that we'll be able

711
00:38:40,130 --> 00:38:42,850
在更大的尺度上测量这种流动
to measure the flow to much larger scales.

712
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:47,290
但Sasha现在有强大的支持者了
But Sasha now has a powerful ally.

713
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:50,260
离多伦多1000英里之外
1,000 miles away,in Toronto,

714
00:38:50,370 --> 00:38:52,860
Laura Mersini-Houghton用自己的计算定义了
Laura Mersini-Houghton was defining her own calculations

715
00:38:52,970 --> 00:38:55,600
宇宙的边缘
about the edge of the Universe

716
00:38:55,710 --> 00:38:58,770
当她收到母亲的来电
when she got a phone call from her mother.

717
00:38:58,880 --> 00:39:02,040
她说，你看新闻了吗？
And she says to me,"Did you see the news

718
00:39:02,150 --> 00:39:05,040
一些被称为暗流或其他什么的东西
"about something called dark flow or another?

719
00:39:05,150 --> 00:39:08,180
有NASA的人员在那儿
There was a NASA person there."

720
00:39:08,290 --> 00:39:10,480
我说，不，我没有
And I said,"No,I haven't."

721
00:39:10,590 --> 00:39:12,510
所以我直接来的计算机前
So I went straight into my computer

722
00:39:12,630 --> 00:39:17,450
找到了NASA里Sasha Kashlinsky领导的团队
and found out that a team at NASA led by Sasha Kashlinsky

723
00:39:17,560 --> 00:39:20,990
报道称他们看见了
had reported they had seen the dark flow

724
00:39:21,100 --> 00:39:23,690
宇宙结构里的暗流
of structure in the Universe.

725
00:39:23,800 --> 00:39:27,230
那真是对我们两年前的预测
That was exactly in perfect agreement

726
00:39:27,340 --> 00:39:30,030
的极好的赞同
with the prediction we had made two years ago.

727
00:39:30,140 --> 00:39:32,830
而令人感觉诡异的是
But what made it spookier was that even the numbers,

728
00:39:32,950 --> 00:39:36,040
那些星系运行的速度
the speed at which those galaxies were moving

729
00:39:36,150 --> 00:39:38,370
和移动的方向
and the direction into which they were moving

730
00:39:38,480 --> 00:39:42,580
在天文学上完全的
were in absolute perfect agreement astronomically

731
00:39:42,690 --> 00:39:44,720
印证了我们的预测
with our predictions.

732
00:39:46,460 --> 00:39:49,220
现在Laura和Sasha都在深思
Now Laura and Sasha are both contemplating

733
00:39:49,330 --> 00:39:53,220
那些我们宇宙之外的奇异图景
just how this exotic landscape outside our Universe

734
00:39:53,330 --> 00:39:55,220
会是怎么样的
might behave.

735
00:39:55,340 --> 00:39:58,730
我们把这块板想象成宇宙之外的图景
I can think of this board as the landscape,

736
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:00,460
能量在这些宇宙的
the energy sites onto which

737
00:40:00,570 --> 00:40:02,760
能量集里
these wave pockets of the Universe

738
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:04,330
最终会平静下来
will eventually settle.

739
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:07,230
现在我把这些能量集
Now,I have to send the wave pockets

740
00:40:07,350 --> 00:40:10,140
发送到这个地带里
through that landscape,through that board

741
00:40:10,250 --> 00:40:12,120
使它落户
in order to populate it.

742
00:40:14,050 --> 00:40:15,910
把这弹子想象成
Think of this marble

743
00:40:16,020 --> 00:40:19,350
引发我们大爆炸的能量脉动
as the pulse of energy that triggered our Big Bang.

744
00:40:19,460 --> 00:40:22,880
很快，另一个能量脉动来到了
Soon,another pulse of energy comes along.

745
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:25,020
它掉进了另一个小坑里
It falls into a different dip,

746
00:40:25,130 --> 00:40:27,750
然后，临近的宇宙诞生了
and a neighboring Universe is born.

747
00:40:27,870 --> 00:40:31,730
那样的宇宙不是我们能涉足的
That Universe is not a place we can ever go.

748
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,360
它们维度的分布
Its arrangement of dimensions

749
00:40:33,470 --> 00:40:35,700
和我们的完全不同
will be completely different from ours.

750
00:40:35,810 --> 00:40:40,670
但我们有一个唯一的方法去感觉它的存在
But there is one way we can sense its presence.

751
00:40:40,780 --> 00:40:44,000
如果两个宇宙足够接近的话
If the two Universes are close enough together,

752
00:40:44,120 --> 00:40:47,440
它们的引力会把所有物质拉在一起
their gravitational attraction will pull anything with mass

753
00:40:47,550 --> 00:40:50,580
拉向它们各自的边缘
towards their respective edges.

754
00:40:50,690 --> 00:40:52,980
那就是为什么我们看见冷区
That's why we see the cold spot

755
00:40:53,090 --> 00:40:55,820
而且为什么有星系组成的
and that's why there's a dark flow of galaxies

756
00:40:55,930 --> 00:40:58,320
穿越宇宙的暗流
moving across the cosmos.

757
00:40:58,430 --> 00:41:02,660
那是因为其他宇宙在拉动我们的
This other Universe is pulling on ours.

758
00:41:02,770 --> 00:41:06,060
大约3，4年前
Until about three,four years ago,

759
00:41:06,170 --> 00:41:09,260
我们对多重宇宙一无所知
we knew nothing of the multiverse.

760
00:41:09,380 --> 00:41:11,460
但是，在近几年
However,things are changing dramatically

761
00:41:11,580 --> 00:41:12,900
这已经有了显著的变化
in the last few years.

762
00:41:13,010 --> 00:41:16,940
科技帮助我们去发现
Technology is helping us find signatures

763
00:41:17,050 --> 00:41:18,970
多重宇宙存在的印记
of the existence of the multiverse.

764
00:41:19,090 --> 00:41:21,740
但对于世界范围的宇宙学科来说
But across the world of cosmology,

765
00:41:21,850 --> 00:41:25,180
对于这种富争议性的工作
the reactions to these scientists' controversial work

766
00:41:25,290 --> 00:41:26,650
有各种各样的反应
is mixed.

767
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:28,480
如果他们有一个是对的
If any one of them is right,

768
00:41:28,590 --> 00:41:31,180
牵涉的影响会非常巨大
the implications would be enormous.

769
00:41:31,300 --> 00:41:35,660
为什么我们需要关心宇宙的大小和形状？
Why do we even care about the size and shape of the Universe?

770
00:41:35,770 --> 00:41:38,490
因为里面的内容很重要
That part of the story is critical

771
00:41:38,600 --> 00:41:41,430
对我们试图理解它从何而来
for our attempts to understand how it all came into being,

772
00:41:41,540 --> 00:41:43,360
为什么它会这样
why it is the way it is,

773
00:41:43,480 --> 00:41:45,530
为什么我们周围看起来是这样的
and why we see what we see around us.

774
00:41:45,650 --> 00:41:49,040
这些都有不同的答案
All these questions have very different answers

775
00:41:49,150 --> 00:41:51,140
如果我们能探索到无限当中包含什么
if we're looking at the infinite story

776
00:41:51,250 --> 00:41:52,640
或有限当中包含什么
or the finite story.

777
00:41:52,750 --> 00:41:55,110
我们就能够说，看，这就是宇宙
We'd be able to say,"Look,here is the Universe.

778
00:41:55,220 --> 00:41:57,840
这就是它的形状，就是我们生活的地方
This is its shape. And that's where we live."

779
00:41:57,960 --> 00:42:00,480
而且那是物理学的革命
And that's a revolution in physics --

780
00:42:00,590 --> 00:42:02,780
至少在我们能想象到
going outside our Universe,

781
00:42:02,900 --> 00:42:05,450
宇宙之外是怎么样子的
at least with the power of our imagination.

782
00:42:05,570 --> 00:42:09,890
这就是为什么我们人类如此特别
But then that's what makes human beings special.

783
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:13,030
偶尔
Every now and again,

784
00:42:13,140 --> 00:42:17,200
我们对宇宙的洞察和我们的立场
our perception of the Universe and our place in it

785
00:42:17,310 --> 00:42:19,670
酝酿着一场革命
undergoes a revolution.

786
00:42:19,780 --> 00:42:24,600
上一世纪前，我们曾经认为
We used to think the Earth was the center of all creation.

787
00:42:24,720 --> 00:42:26,970
地球是宇宙的中心
For the past century,

788
00:42:27,090 --> 00:42:29,580
但我们慢慢了解和接受到
we've learned to accept that we live

789
00:42:29,690 --> 00:42:32,680
在一个难以想象巨大的宇宙当中
in a nondescript region of a backwater galaxy

790
00:42:32,790 --> 00:42:37,430
我们其实生活在一个安静的星系里不值一提的区域
in a Universe that is unimaginably vast.

791
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:43,440
现在是改变我们的观点的时候了
Now it's time for another change of perspective.

792
00:42:45,910 --> 00:42:50,460
曾经我们被认为是无限的宇宙
Our Universe itself,once assumed to be infinite,

793
00:42:50,580 --> 00:42:53,200
作为一个巨大多重宇宙里谦虚的成员
might have to shrink down and take its rightful place

794
00:42:53,310 --> 00:42:57,040
或被降级到它应有的位置
as a humble member of a truly giant multiverse,

795
00:42:57,150 --> 00:43:00,040
一个充满小宇宙的多重宇宙
a multiverse filled with Universes

796
00:43:00,150 --> 00:43:03,230
超越了我们最狂野的想象
beyond our wildest imaginations.

797
00:43:04,320 --> 00:43:07,920
-- 感谢观赏 --

